{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00431",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.74,
      "end_seconds": 4.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor, the receptionist said you'd see me now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.26,
      "end_seconds": 8.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Of course, put it down anywhere. So, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.24,
      "end_seconds": 22.03,
      "duration_seconds": 11.79,
      "text": "So, I've been feeling very thirsty, doctor. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.08,
      "end_seconds": 27.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "How long have you had it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.68,
      "end_seconds": 36.51,
      "duration_seconds": 7.83,
      "text": "It's been about a month, I'm fairly sure. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.63,
      "end_seconds": 43.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "How would you describe it, mild, moderate, severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.52,
      "end_seconds": 58.35,
      "duration_seconds": 13.83,
      "text": "Pretty moderate, if I'm being honest. And I've been passing urine a lot as well. Oh, uh, and tingling in the feet. That's been about the same, two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.87,
      "end_seconds": 61.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "What's the pattern, is it there all day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.6,
      "end_seconds": 64.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "It happens every other day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.74,
      "end_seconds": 69.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Have you been feeling very thirsty at any time before this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.33,
      "end_seconds": 77.12,
      "duration_seconds": 6.79,
      "text": "Okay, so yes, something like this happened last year, and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.45,
      "end_seconds": 80.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.72,
      "end_seconds": 82.59,
      "duration_seconds": 0.87,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.1,
      "end_seconds": 97.29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Any weight loss, fever or chest pain at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.67,
      "end_seconds": 101.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "No, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.86,
      "end_seconds": 105.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.37,
      "end_seconds": 108.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "No, nothing I'm aware of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.7,
      "end_seconds": 113.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.44,
      "end_seconds": 128.82,
      "duration_seconds": 14.38,
      "text": "Not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.38,
      "end_seconds": 133.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.87,
      "end_seconds": 146.63,
      "duration_seconds": 12.76,
      "text": "I mean, I have high cholesterol, for two years. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.06,
      "end_seconds": 147.76,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.88,
      "end_seconds": 152.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Yes, diabetes. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.07,
      "end_seconds": 168.71,
      "duration_seconds": 14.64,
      "text": "Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.15,
      "end_seconds": 173.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.54,
      "end_seconds": 176.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.41,
      "end_seconds": 183.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "Okay, so no, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.22,
      "end_seconds": 187.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.76,
      "end_seconds": 188.51,
      "duration_seconds": 0.75,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.59,
      "end_seconds": 205.87,
      "duration_seconds": 7.28,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Let's go through your medication. What are you taking? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.52,
      "end_seconds": 212.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Oh, I'm on atorvastatin, at night for my cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.31,
      "end_seconds": 215.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.58,
      "end_seconds": 217.3,
      "duration_seconds": 0.72,
      "text": "20 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.08,
      "end_seconds": 221.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "I'll try to keep this as efficient as I can."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.03,
      "end_seconds": 225.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Thank you, you know, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.86,
      "end_seconds": 229.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Let me check your vitals now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.41,
      "end_seconds": 244.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Okay, give me a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.77,
      "end_seconds": 262.42,
      "duration_seconds": 5.65,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 165 over 97, temperature 36.7, pulse is 84 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.74,
      "end_seconds": 265.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.41,
      "end_seconds": 283.68,
      "duration_seconds": 18.27,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment. I'll be straight with you about how this works. Most of what we see in clinic turns out to be manageable, and the history you give me is often more useful than any single test, so thank you for being so detailed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 284.63,
      "end_seconds": 286.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Thank you, that really helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.07,
      "end_seconds": 307.25,
      "duration_seconds": 19.18,
      "text": "Putting together what you've described, my working impression is diabetes that isn't well controlled. The reason I say that is that the way you describe it fits together. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been feeling very thirsty for about a month, moderate, and no chest pain or fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.66,
      "end_seconds": 309.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.55,
      "end_seconds": 314.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.59,
      "end_seconds": 327.32,
      "duration_seconds": 11.73,
      "text": "Yes, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.95,
      "end_seconds": 349.34,
      "duration_seconds": 21.39,
      "text": "Let's get kidney function tests, for diabetes. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. We should do an eye check for diabetes. Let's use glimepiride, 1 milligrams, before breakfast, until we review. It's for blood sugar control. The pharmacy will go through the details again when you pick it up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 353.31,
      "end_seconds": 354.17,
      "duration_seconds": 0.86,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.61,
      "end_seconds": 374.35,
      "duration_seconds": 19.74,
      "text": "Check your feet every day, and never walk barefoot. Cut back on sweets, sugary drinks and white rice, and keep to regular meal times. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think. Don't skip meals, and try to eat smaller portions more often through the day. I'll also refer you to a dietitian."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 375.64,
      "end_seconds": 378.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Uh, sure, where do I go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 379.51,
      "end_seconds": 386.34,
      "duration_seconds": 6.83,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if you vomit repeatedly or become drowsy, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 386.71,
      "end_seconds": 387.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Okay, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 391.53,
      "end_seconds": 393.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Come back after the results are back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 394.31,
      "end_seconds": 396.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "Okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 397.28,
      "end_seconds": 401.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Just to confirm, what are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 403.29,
      "end_seconds": 412.28,
      "duration_seconds": 8.99,
      "text": "So, I take the glimepiride, 1 milligrams, before breakfast and come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 413.14,
      "end_seconds": 417.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Take care, and don't hesitate to call if anything changes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 418.48,
      "end_seconds": 421.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "No, you've explained it well. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 422.69,
      "end_seconds": 423.48,
      "duration_seconds": 0.79,
      "text": "Alright, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}